IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gaa-incapacity`

-- Guardianship and Administration Act 1990 (WA), Parts 9, 9A, 9B, ss 4, 43, 45, 64, 110ZD, 110ZJ, 119, with the
-- Guardianship and Administration Regulations 2005, regs 6-9 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case. Fixtures are generated (scratchpad gen_wa_guardianship-and-administration-act-1990_baseline.py); expected
-- results were written by hand from the deposited text.
--
-- Life facts (workbench scenarios/au/wa/cradle-to-grave-*/facts.json): Chloe born 2003-03-14; Liam born 1999-07-22; Oliver
-- born 2030-09-05. Jake born 2006-08-30, a stroke 2063-03-14 (k090); Ruby born 2033-01-22. Daniel born 1996-04-09; Priya born
-- 1997-08-23. Event dates: c025 2021-03-14; c082 2041-02-14; c091 2063-03-14; c095 2073-03-14; d085 2065-04-09; d090
-- 2074-06-12; k092 2063-05-15; k096 2075-04-02.
-- The scenarios do not name Chloe's attorney or enduring guardian, nor Daniel's: each event lists only the spouse beside the
-- maker (c082, c091: Liam; d085: Priya), so the spouse is taken as the appointee -- an INFERENCE. Whether Jake had full legal
-- capacity two months after his stroke is not stated; both answers are asserted. What the directives say is not stated.

§ `Fixtures`

`Chloe's power to Liam` MEANS AttorneyInstrument WITH
    `in the form or substantially in the form of Form 1` IS TRUE
    `what paragraph 4 declares` IS `it continues despite my later incapacity`
    `witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `other witnesses aged 18 or more who are not a donee or substitute donee` IS 1
    `a Form 2 acceptance is executed by every donee` IS TRUE
    `a substitute donee is appointed` IS FALSE
    `a Form 2 acceptance is executed by every substitute donee` IS FALSE

`a power witnessed by an authorised witness and the donee` MEANS AttorneyInstrument WITH
    `in the form or substantially in the form of Form 1` IS TRUE
    `what paragraph 4 declares` IS `it continues despite my later incapacity`
    `witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `other witnesses aged 18 or more who are not a donee or substitute donee` IS 0
    `a Form 2 acceptance is executed by every donee` IS TRUE
    `a substitute donee is appointed` IS FALSE
    `a Form 2 acceptance is executed by every substitute donee` IS FALSE

