    `what paragraph 4 declares` IS `both paragraphs are left in`
    `witnesses authorised to take declarations` IS 1
    `other witnesses aged 18 or more who are not a donee or substitute donee` IS 1
    `a Form 2 acceptance is executed by every donee` IS TRUE
    `a substitute donee is appointed` IS FALSE
    `a Form 2 acceptance is executed by every substitute donee` IS FALSE

